{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Lunar Knight of the blood moon, and tonight is your night.\u00a0 It's time for violence.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the twisted horrors conjured by moon in this horde survival roguelite. Gain experience, grow stronger, and synergize your weapons to crush the enemy forces and survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, action-packed 20 minute battles as you fight your way to day-break</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through five different biomes, all corrupted by the blood moon: a grave-riddled forest, bloody desert, burning farmstead, molten tundra, and the eldritch dark side of the lunar plane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay unique bosses that lead their armies from the front.\u00a0 Each commander has unique attack patterns, spells, and combat prowess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest souls of your felled enemies. Gain experience, and level up your weapons with synergistic upgrades to craft unique and powerful builds for each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master and synergize your arsenal by switching weapons with skill-based swap and dual wield\u00a0mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek favor from the blood moon and unlock  otherworldly weapons, permanent blessings, and weapon mastery ranks that make your stronger with each victory</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master swapping and dual wielding your weapons to mow down hordes of enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/78a62c47cc1c8a330893d08efa716116.poster.avif?t=1772895039\" width=600 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/78a62c47cc1c8a330893d08efa716116.webm?t=1772895039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make heads roll.\u00a0 Take down punishing bosses with unique combos and abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/4157c2aa24307e1985a3e1c3badbeb88.poster.avif?t=1772895039\" width=600 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/4157c2aa24307e1985a3e1c3badbeb88.webm?t=1772895039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine your powers to discover their deadly, evolved forms.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/162c286ad4df0f13bf0c0dc9f1555e72.poster.avif?t=1772895039\" width=600 height=369 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/extras/162c286ad4df0f13bf0c0dc9f1555e72.webm?t=1772895039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Content List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 stages with unique enemies and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 different weapon masteries to empower your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 blessing that increase your strength with every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 milestones in-game challenges with unique rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of abilities with unique upgrade trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup evolution system that transforms your abilities into unique evolved forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique monsters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115310?t=1772895039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/9699b1d4f314a951b7318c09c97f489d98e05e0a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772895039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/d8913b3eaea34f7344618f3829a2b031738700d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772895039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115310/d8913b3eaea34f7344618f3829a2b031738700d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772895039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3314000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Lunar Knight of the blood moon, and tonight is your night.\u00a0 It's time for violence.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the twisted horrors conjured by moon in this horde survival roguelite. Gain experience, grow stronger, and synergize your weapons to crush the enemy forces and survive the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, action-packed 20 minute battles as you fight your way to day-break</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through five different biomes, all corrupted by the blood moon: a grave-riddled forest, bloody desert, burning farmstead, molten tundra, an